{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2f39f02c-d0f8-8b09-b638-fd7cb6e3883f",
  "created_at": "2026-03-05T14:39:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Aisha Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:33:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. Happy Thursday, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:33:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. Is it all right if I ask about a walking path? I'm trying to find out if one of the beach paths is closed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:33:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, absolutely. Which one are you thinking of? We have a few along the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:34:00-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one at the beach park, the paved path that runs along the back of the sand, past the pavilion. I went last weekend and there was orange fencing across it. Is it all right if I ask whether that's for the winter or if it's a real closure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:34:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Let me pull up our notices. Are you talking about Easton's Beach, the one with the Cliff Walk end and the carousel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:34:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the one. Easton's. The stretch near the pavilion end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:34:41-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, give me one second here. [pause] Alright. So there's a section of that walkway that's closed off right now for repairs. The boardwalk-style part got some damage over the winter, so they've fenced it off while they sort out the work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:35:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Is it all right if I ask whether there's a way around it? I walk it most mornings, or I did."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:35:13-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can go around on the sidewalk along the road side, and the sand's open if the tide is out. The fenced part is just that one section. The rest of the path is open on both sides of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:35:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And do you know when it's supposed to reopen? Is it all right if I ask that too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:35:42-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ask away, that's what I'm here for. I don't have a firm reopening date on my screen. The note says repairs are scheduled for spring, once the weather settles. If you want a better idea I can take your number and have someone from the parks side call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be good, thank you. Is it all right if I give you the number now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:36:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, I'm ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:36:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0159. And the name is Aisha Cohen. C-O-H-E-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:36:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Aisha Cohen, 401-555-0159. I'll put it in as a question about the Easton's Beach path closure and the reopening date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:36:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Sorry, one more thing, if that's all right. Could you repeat what you said about the way around it? I want to write it down so I remember when I go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:36:50-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. The closed part is one section of the walkway near the pavilion end. To get around it you can use the sidewalk on the road side, or walk on the sand if the tide is out. The rest of the path on both sides of the fence is open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:37:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hold on. Sidewalk on the road side, or the sand at low tide. Rest of the path open on both sides. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:37:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:37:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And repairs are planned for spring, but no firm date yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:37:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Spring is what the notice says, and somebody will call you back if there's more detail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:37:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Wow, I just looked at the clock. Time really flies on the phone, doesn't it? I thought we had only been talking a minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:37:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It does, it does. We've been at it a few minutes, but no rush on my end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:38:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is it all right if I ask one last thing? Is the other path, the one by the second beach, open? I might walk there in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:38:21-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me check. [pause] I'm not seeing any closure notice for that one, so as far as my list goes, it's open. If you get there and see fencing, it would be something new, and you can call us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:38:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. That's helpful. I'll try that one tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:38:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:38:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's everything. Thank you for your help, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Aisha. Enjoy your walk, and someone will be in touch about the reopening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:39:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T14:39:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
